                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Labour market position of graduates from the various types of Higher Professional Education.   Characteristics of higher professional education in 2001/2002 / working - and administrative experience / further education / occupational status / experiences with unemployment / present job and profession / transition from education to present employment / quality of the college of higher professional education / refresher courses and contact with college of higher professional education / background characteristics of respondent.   See also the   ROA website</p>"
